---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /book/
title: "Book Business Analyst Coaching | Flotog BA Insights"
titleIsFull: true
description: "Book a free 30-minute BA career consultation or a 1-hour coaching session (AED 400): interview prep, CV review and career planning with Tosin Ogunkoya."
includeServiceSchema: true
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Book coaching"
    url: "/book/"
faqs:
  - q: "What happens after I book?"
    a: "You receive a calendar confirmation with a video call link. Before the session, send a short note on your background and what you want to get out of it so the time goes on your real problem."
  - q: "How do I pay for a coaching session?"
    a: "After choosing your time, pay AED 400 through a secure Ziina payment page by card, Apple Pay or Google Pay. Your booking is confirmed as soon as the payment is received. The free consultation needs no payment."
  - q: "Can I reschedule?"
    a: "Yes. Use the reschedule link in your booking confirmation, or contact us on WhatsApp."
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Book coaching</nav>
    <h1>Book business analyst coaching</h1>
    <p class="lead">Start with a free 30-minute consultation, or go straight to a focused one-hour session. Sessions run online, so you can join from Dubai or anywhere in the world.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:1.5rem">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="offers">
      {%- for s in services %}
      <article class="offer{% if loop.first %} offer-featured{% endif %}" id="{{ s.id }}">
        <h2 class="h3" style="font-size:var(--step-2)">{{ s.name }}</h2>
        <div class="offer-meta">
          <span class="offer-price">{{ s.priceDisplay }}</span>
          <span class="offer-duration">{{ s.duration }}</span>
        </div>
        <p>{{ s.description }}</p>
        <ul>
          {%- for i in s.includes %}<li>{{ i }}</li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <a class="btn{% if not loop.first %} btn-ghost{% endif %}" href="{{ site.booking[s.bookingKey] }}">Book {{ s.name | lower }}</a>
        {%- if s.price > 0 and site.booking.paymentLink %}
        <div class="pay-step">
          <p><strong>Two simple steps:</strong> choose your time, then pay AED {{ s.price }} securely with Ziina (card, Apple Pay or Google Pay). Your session is confirmed as soon as payment is received.</p>
          <a class="pay-link" href="{{ site.booking.paymentLink }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Pay AED {{ s.price }} with Ziina →</a>
        </div>
        {%- endif %}
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">Prefer to ask a question first? <a href="{{ site.whatsapp }}">Message us on WhatsApp</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>How it works</h2></div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><h3>Pick a time</h3><p>Choose a slot that suits your time zone. You get a confirmation and a video link straight away.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Share your context</h3><p>Send a few lines on your background, the role you want and what's blocking you.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Leave with a plan</h3><p>Every session ends with written action points you can start on that week.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Booking questions</h2></div>
    <div class="faq">
      {%- for f in faqs %}
      <details><summary>{{ f.q }}</summary><p>{{ f.a }}</p></details>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
